data: {"answer": "This room is the **Patio Close-up** (shown as 'Patio · Up Close' in the tour). It displays a Wi-Fi sign with instructions for joining the guest network, demonstrating that only guest network details should appear on public signs. You can see systems for both Guest and Staff Wi-Fi here, along with controls for Network Segmentation.", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "What does the Wi-Fi (Guest & Staff) do?", "en": "What does the Wi-Fi (Guest & Staff) do?", "zh": "無線網路（訪客與員工）是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.03, "total_s": 8.04}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "patio_near", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "patio_near"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.8}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "patio_near", "label": "Room", "en": "Patio · Up Close", "zh": "露台近看"}, {"key": "wifi", "label": "System", "en": "Wi-Fi (Guest & Staff)", "zh": "無線網路（訪客與員工）"}, {"key": "segmentation", "label": "Control", "en": "Network Segmentation", "zh": "網段隔離"}], "edges": [{"a": "wifi", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "patio_near"}, {"a": "segmentation", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "patio_near"}, {"a": "segmentation", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "wifi"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Patio Close-up · Wi-Fi Sign (called 'Patio · Up Close' in the tour)\nWhat it shows: The Wi-Fi sign tells guests how to join the guest network.\nKey lesson: Only guest network details belong on a public sign.\nSystems here: Wi-Fi (Guest & Staff)\nControls you can see: Network Segmentation\nHidden security weaknesses in this room: 1 (the player has to spot them; do not reveal them)\nExits: Pool · Data Lake, Guest Arrival & Wi-Fi (called 'Lakeside Patio' in the tour), Lawn · Assembly Point & Continuity (called 'Lakeside Lawn' in the tour), Pier · Deliveries & Vendors (called 'Clubhouse Pier' in the tour)", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.03, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 603, "prompt_s": 2.28, "gen_tokens": 72, "gen_s": 5.72, "tok_per_s": 12.6, "first_token_s": 2.3}}, "state": {}}

